Lighting solutions: multi-stage multi-level LED lighting regulation to meet all apartment residents' needs: from cozy evening ambient lighting, wardrobe lighting when opened to bright detailed light flow when working in the kitchen or tidying rooms. Each room is equipped with luxurious Italian and Spanish designer lamps; In the bathroom: cozy ambient lighting for a relaxing shower in the evening, more powerful lighting at the mirror, cosmetic mirror with magnifying glass and lighting; night non-blinding lighting

;

Communications / security systems: Individual design TOP quality JUNG switches and sockets, thoughtfully arranged "never too many"; Schneider electric automation; TV cable led to the bedroom, an internet cable comes to each room; connected fiber optic; Installed and connected to the control panel alarm in both the apartment and the basement with all necessary and possible burglary/fire/water leakage sensors, remotely controlled.

Home appliances: most of the equipment intended for the German market: SIEMENS oven with all possible functions (except microwave); SIEMENS dishwasher; Quiet and powerful extractor hood with a reverse valve; Quiet and reliable refrigerator LIEBHERR best in its class; INSINKERATOR food waste disposer in the sink - the most powerful version (operates reliably, quietly); SIEMENS hob; MIELE washing machine and MIELE dryer; KERMI individual design luxurious and practical towel radiator in the bathroom with very precise temperature control according to several scenarios; HEATED mirror in the bathroom to prevent condensation; SONY 65'' TV; SONOS music audio system home cinema + audio in each room (this entire audio system is sold separately);

