APARTMENTS FOR SALE IN A RENOVATED BUILDING ON RUSNĖS STREET 8, ŠILUTĖ.

Unique apartments are for sale on Rusnės Street 8, Šilutė, in a renovated 19th-century historic building. In this idyllic natural corner, you can create your own peaceful haven where you can spend time with family and friends. Surround yourself with tranquility, beauty, the joy of water, and entertainment. The views of the nearby flowing river will add coziness and exclusivity to your home. For leisurely walks, you can choose from various routes, such as the nearby manor park or the forest park that stretches along the Šyša River to the old railway bridge. The Šilutė sports and wellness complex, located just 100 meters away, is perfect for active recreation. It offers a swimming pool, sauna complex, various saunas, a recreational water area, a weightlifting hall, a gym, aerobics and yoga studios, a spa center with a pool, and a café. From the Šilutė small boat harbor, the "Curonian Delta Express" ferry operates regular trips to Nida.

