EXCLUSIVE APARTMENTS FOR SALE IN NERINGA, NEWLY BUILT COMPLEX WITH 12 TERRACES.
12 TERAS - A+ energy class apartment complex, located in the heart of Pervalka. This settlement is a tiny pearl of the Curonian Spit in the shelter of sand dunes, protected from harsh winds and the hum of the city. A breathtaking landscape of dead dunes and a view of the historic Pervalka lighthouse are just a 15-minute walk away. Nearby - Naglii nature reserve untouched by human hands. Less than 300 inhabitants live here, so those looking for privacy and quiet rest will love this place. The great weather and the tranquility of the town will enchant everyone who visits here. And for those who want to exchange silence for a short time for the hustle and bustle of the city, you can reach Nida or Juodkrantė by car in about 10 minutes.
The apartments sold in the complex are designed so that living in them is comfortable in all seasons. Both in summer and winter you can enjoy the beauty and peace of nature. A large selection of fully equipped apartments with a view of the lagoon or the forest, the biggest advantage of which are spacious balconies or terraces. It is also possible to purchase apartments on two floors. The uniqueness of this project is the spa area, which can be used by the residents of building B all year round for an additional fee. The homes are built based on sustainable solutions, the architecture is combined with a unique landscape, so the exterior combines modernity and naturalness. Clinker bricks and wood paneling were used for the facade decoration. Subtle and modern apartment interior. In the rooms, the design of the common space and the range of pastel colors have been maintained.
This complex includes parking spaces and storage rooms, which will also be available for an additional fee.
Cozy, bright, peaceful apartments could be not only your summer residence, but also your dream home. This is a great investment with lasting value!
