Experience Luxury and History in Juodkrantė, Neringa
Welcome to Juodkrantė, a charming town in Neringa, where serene nature meets modern comfort. Known as the 'Amber Bay', Juodkrantė is a treasure trove of natural beauty and historical significance. Our exclusive apartment is nestled in this idyllic setting, offering a life of comfort and elegance. The town is a blend of stunning landscapes, pristine beaches, and the iconic Curonian Spit, making it an ideal location for a luxurious lifestyle.
The apartment is a symbol of luxury living. With spacious rooms, high-end finishes, and directly located next to a hill of trees, it provides an unmatched living experience. Despite its convenient location, it offers a sense of privacy and seclusion, characteristic of the quiet neighborhood.
Juodkrantė's rich history is as captivating as its natural beauty. The town was a major center for amber processing in the 19th century, and the spirit of this golden era still resonates in its charming streets, villas and wooden houses. Living in Juodkrantė means waking up to the sound of waves, strolling along the beach at sunset, and exploring the rich cultural heritage. It's about embracing a lifestyle that's as luxurious as it is relaxing, and as rich in history as it is in natural beauty.

Experience Unmatched Luxury
We present to you an unparalleled living experience in Neringa - a spacious 152.21 sqm apartment (basement included), fully renovated in 2021. This renovation, carried out by certified experts, involved a thorough upgrade of all insulation, plumbing, electrical systems, chimney flue, windows and doors among other features. As Neringa’s largest and most luxurious apartment, it is now ready to be the perfect home for those who seek nothing but the finest.
The apartment boasts four individual bedrooms of varying sizes (13.53, 16.49, 10.83, 9.33 sqm), each offering a unique charm and comfort. The heart of the home is a spacious living room (37.95 sqm), featuring a highly efficient wood-burning fireplace capable of warming the entire apartment during winter (Jotul F 520 High Top, 3 windows). For added convenience, each room is also equipped with efficient electronic radiators (AEG).
The kitchen (9.01 sqm) is a chef's dream, complete with a large two-door fridge with a water dispenser (Samsung), a dishwasher (Electrolux), a washing machine (Electrolux), a large farm sink (Villeroy & Boch), and an oversized cooking area (Bosch). The use of premium materials such as granite countertops, wooden kitchen cabinets, and natural stone flooring adds a touch of elegance to the space (Arsenalas).
The dining room (18.08 sqm) is perfect for hosting large family gatherings or dinner parties, comfortably accommodating 8-10 people. The apartment also features a guest toilet (1.43 sqm), a must-have for any modern household, and a decently sized bathroom complete with a cedar-wood sauna for 2-3 people and a large walk-in shower (6.25 sqm). The guest toilet and bathroom are adorned with Italian marble, enhancing the luxurious feel of the apartment.
The three-layered oak parquet flooring throughout the apartment adds a warm and natural ambiance, while the granite window sills offer a touch of sophistication. The large basement (15.57 sqm) provides ample storage space.
The apartment's water heating is powered by a highly efficient tankless water heater (AEG), ensuring unlimited hot water supply without unnecessary energy consumption. To top it all off, the apartment features a terrace that runs along the entire side of the building, perfect for outdoor relaxation and entertainment.
The living room, dining room, and one bedroom are equipped with recuperators (Litmax), ensuring a continuous flow of fresh air throughout the property. This feature is particularly beneficial for maintaining a comfortable and healthy indoor environment, even if the apartment is primarily used during the summer season. It also effectively combats humidity, preserving the integrity and comfort of your home all year round.
We understand that moving can be a hassle, and we want to make your transition as smooth as possible. That's why the furniture is included in the price. Each piece of furniture has been carefully selected to complement the apartment's design and enhance its luxurious feel (Oaky Oak, Fornestas, Magres). From the comfortable beds in the bedrooms to the stylish seating in the living room, every item contributes to the overall elegance of the home. If you're looking for a truly ready-to-move-in option, this is an opportunity you won't want to miss.
This is a unique chance to acquire a piece of Neringa's luxury real estate. We invite you to schedule a viewing and immerse yourself in the opulence this apartment has to offer. Please note, we kindly request that only genuinely interested and serious buyers reach out to us. We look forward to sharing this exquisite property with you. The price is negotiable!
